cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MAGAT, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MAGAT: Multi-Action Game Algorithm Tester"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  MAGAT evaluates search algorithms for multi-action games, where a turn is a sequence of actions, by
  replanning single turns on a pinned portfolio of positions under a compute-unit budget. A unit is a priced
  count of operations, calibrated per machine, so results measured on different machines can be replayed,
  re-priced and compared. The first game is Tribes.
